    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "砲兵　二中隊四十八人小隊ニテ四小隊"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "砲兵 二中隊、四十八人小隊にて四小隊（ほうへい にちゅうたい、しじゅうはちにん しょうたいにて よんしょうたい）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Artillery: two companies; reckoned at forty-eight men to a platoon, four platoons. The last eleven glyphs are set in reduced type in the same column. Four platoons at forty-eight is 192 men. This column stands to the RIGHT of the Funai maru-marker and belongs to the previous domain, Fukuyama, whose maru-marker I read on lower_p215_right."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "福山砲兵"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
