        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "募兵常備 六中隊、四十八人小隊にて十二小隊（ぼへいじょうび ろくちゅうたい、しじゅうはちにん しょうたいにて じゅうにしょうたい）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Recruited standing troops: six companies; reckoned at forty-eight men to a platoon, twelve platoons - 576 men. Also Fukuyama's. Adding the recto's twenty-four infantry platoons to this leaf's four and twelve gives forty platoons, 1,920 men, which is not the 2,300 of the grand total four columns to the left: the two figures count the same force on different principles, by arm and by status."
